{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beyond-the-grave/1404386-beyond-the-grave-dinner-at-carl\u2019s","id":1404386,"title":"[Beyond the Grave] Dinner At Carl\u2019s","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","They Came From...","...Beyond the Grave!"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-24T05:32:22-07:00","id":1404386,"title":"[Beyond the Grave] Dinner At Carl\u2019s","content":"In two weeks I will demo game of <b>They Came From Beyond the Grave!</b> ( <b>BtG</b> ) for my buddies. As we are just after start of Kickstarter, we only have KS preview manuscript \u2013 and we will not have full text of it. But, I\u2019m proud backer of previous <b>Beneath the Sea! </b>(<b> BtS</b> ) KS, so having corebook for this. Having <b>BtS</b>, I may run <b>BtG</b> with it\u2019s Archetypes, Quips and Cinematics. I only would not have Monsters for <b>BtG</b> \u2013 and why this topic, where I prepare stuff for my story. Later, I may sum up how game went on.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://scontent.frix7-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.0-9/116140535_10214846466510097_7264189136107174372_o.jpg?_nc_cat=111&amp;_nc_sid=340051&amp;_nc_ohc=YaVftu1ahYgAX--CU7P&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.frix7-1.fna&amp;oh=9c2111c0f68cca13a515f22259430c53&amp;oe=5F4244E1\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Here is Trailer for our movie then\u2026 \ud83d\ude09<br /> <br /> /Said in dead serious movie trailer voice/<br /> <br /> <i>THIS SUMMER. IN TECHNICOLOR. Director Karol Litwinhchuk presents\u2026<br /> <br /> DINNER AT CARL\u2019S!<br /> <br /> It\u2019s 70s in England. No, EARLY 70s. Rainy, Saturday evening. Group of strangers were invited to old, Victorian estate, tens of miles from London The sea slashes ram the cliff on which the property is located. Their mysterious host \u2013 millionaire Karl Schmidt \u2013 announced in the invitation to give them all his fortune. Will they survive all night here? Will they survive...<br /> <br /> DINNER AT CARL\u2019S!</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-24-2020, 09:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-24T06:22:01-07:00","id":1404388,"title":"","content":"This sounds really cool \ud83d\ude0a. But you might wanna wait till you read the whole manuscript?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-24T06:31:25-07:00","id":1404390,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/they-came-from/beyond-the-grave/1404386-beyond-the-grave-dinner-at-carl\u2019s?p=1404388#post1404388\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But you might wanna wait till you read the whole manuscript?</div> </div> </div> </div>I have the <b>Beneath the Sea</b> game corebook, so I have, already, main rules and example Monsters. And I will run game, most probably, at August 8th. Till this day I should have also Quips &amp; Cinematics from <b>Beyond the Grave</b>, as those are on the appropriate chapter in <b>Beneath the Sea</b>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/they-came-from-beyond-the-grave/posts/2900171\" target=\"_blank\">Dates from <b>Beyond the Grave</b> KS</a>:<ul><li>July 28: Character Creation, Skills &amp; Attributes</li> <li>August 4: The Storypath System and working with Cinematic Powers</li> <li>August 11: Monsters and Setting</li> <li>August 18: Directing and Scenarios</li> </ul>Only Monsters I will not have, but those I can make myself, based on<b> BtS</b> examples.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-24-2020, 09:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-24T11:05:49-07:00","id":1404431,"title":"","content":"As it's obvious- in <b><i>Dinner At Carl's</i></b> - I will dwell into <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/OldDarkHouse\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Old, Dark House </b>trope</a> - TVTropes wiki entry will nicely add to research on the story and possible Monsters for it... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-24T22:52:46-07:00","id":1404530,"title":"","content":"Okay, let\u2019s start with something simple, but crucial\u2026<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Carl Schmidt</b></span><br /> Carl is old occultist. He was member of Thule Society in Nazi Germany that somehow lived through the WW II unscarred. After war, he started some businesses in England that let him to sustain his family money. Now Carl is going to be precisely 66 years old in this fateful evening \u2013 it\u2019s his birthday! For best possible gift from the fate he chosen to take new, younger body of one of his guests as his own. Rest of the guest are to be sacrificed in elaborated ritual of soul transfer in the time of this night. With the help of DEVIL HIMSELF!<br /> <br /> <b>Skills:</b> Aim 2, Athletics 2, Close Combat 2, Culture 3, Empathy 2, Enigmas 2, Humanities 4, Integrity 4, Medicine 1, Persuasion 3, Science 1<br /> <b>Attributes:</b> Intellect 4, Cunning 3, Resolve 4;<br /> Might 2, Dexterity 3, Stamina 1;<br /> Presence 2, Manipulation 4, Composure 3<br /> <b>Health:</b> 9 ( Sicked, old man )<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Special Rules</b></span><br /> &lt; To come \u2013 You can propose some. \ud83d\ude09&gt;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-25T06:28:05-07:00","id":1404578,"title":"","content":"This sounds really cool. I\u2019m really excited about this Kickstarter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T01:03:18-07:00","id":1407873,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>NPCs</b></span><br /> <br /> With <b>Monsters and Setting</b> preview for <b>Beyond the Grave</b>, here I propose main NPCs in story.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Carl Schmidt</b></span><br /> Carl is old occultist, with white goatee and hair. He was member of Thule Society in Nazi Germany that somehow lived through the WW II unscarred. After war, he started some businesses in England that let him to sustain his family money. Now Carl is going to be precisely 66 years old in this fateful evening \u2013 it\u2019s his birthday! For best possible gift from the fate he chosen to take new, younger body of one of his guests as his own. Rest of the guest are to be sacrificed in elaborated ritual of soul transfer in the time of this night. With the help of DEVIL HIMSELF!<br /> <b>Skills:</b> Aim 2, Athletics 2, Close Combat 2, Culture 3, Empathy 2, Enigmas 2, Humanities 4, Integrity 4, Medicine 1, Persuasion 3, Science 1<br /> <b>Attributes:</b> Intellect 4, Cunning 3, Resolve 4; Might 2, Dexterity 3, Stamina 1; Presence 2, Manipulation 4, Composure 3<br /> <b>Health:</b> 9 ( Sicked, old man )<br /> <b>Special Rules</b><br /> Same as <b>Devil Worshipper AND Warlock </b>from <b>Beyond the Grave</b> preview<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Igor \u2013 Butler</b></span><br /> <br /> Hunchback butler and major domous of the manor.<br /> Stats \u2013 Same as <b>Devil Worshipper </b>from <b>Beyond the Grave</b> preview<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Bellatrix \u2013 Maid</b></span><br /> <br /> Sensual maid of Schmidt, with long, black hair and black heart.<br /> Stats \u2013 Same as <b>Devil Worshipper </b>from <b>Beyond the Grave</b> preview<br /> <br /> EDIT: Added <b>Warlock</b> Special Rules for Carl, to his previous <b>Devil Worshipper</b> ones. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-14-2020, 03:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-23T00:25:25-07:00","id":1409859,"title":"","content":"Yesterday I run the my own \u2018Dinner at Karl\u2019s\u2019 story with group of friends and my life partner. It was quickly made hodge podge of old manor, mysterious invite, forcing cake/brains to eat by guests, invisible threats and satanic rituals. \ud83d\ude02 Very absurdist and run ad hock. We set to use the Cinematics and Quips systems, so Players got twice the number of them Rewrites on the start and 7 Cinematics to choose from list, instead of general 5 by core rules. I also award good role play and sticking to convention of \u2018bad horror movie\u2019 by new Rewrites, instead Experience \u2013 as it was one-shot. Players by the end used most of them, but we felt they do not really need to generate them \u2013 they spent like about 10 Rewrites, but get back about 5 of them. My partner was most generating one the Rewrites by roleplaying and humor ( he was just sooo good at this \ud83d\ude09 ).<br /> <br /> The other \u2018problem\u2019 ( kinda? ) we found was with no way to make new Quips in play \u2013 partner made great one-liners that where other than those from his sheet \u2013 and even deliver truly Award-Winning scene about it. ( With with water heaters, electrocution and satanic cultists \ud83d\ude01 ) I rolled with making it Award-Winning as it surly would be in trailer or Oscar nomination ceremony \u2013 but by the rules, he could not use it \u2013 as there where no the Quips from his sheet. \ud83d\ude1e<br /> <br /> After all \u2013 great one-shot system, maybe run it once again on Halloween \u2013 only Quips and Cinematics cards are MUST HAVE! I solved this by printing lists of Quips and Cinematics from manuscript preview - and players drew Quips by tossing a pen on them - but the cards of these powers would have made everything MUCH easier, in my opinion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 08-23-2020, 03:27 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}